# resources_gap_ref_texture_view: A texture over an IOSurface backing in task 0 (type 5) and a pixel-format view of it. A ref texture does not support discard, so its view is a plain serializer texture: 60 on the view throws from its discard and faults. 314 takes Resource::get_resource of the ref texture. Then 54 deletes the backing from task 0's list (the ref texture keeps it), a fill through the ref texture with invalidateGuest only (flag 2) leaves the backing's guest copy invalid, and rvg_device_finish_suspend flushes: task 0 no longer holds the backing, and task 1's flush finds the ref texture needing a synchronize (it reads its backing's validity) and evicts it, which does nothing. The fill never reaches the backing's pages. In-process only: in the service a type 5 texture aborts (textures_backing_ref_service).
